{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَاهُ","d":"anzalnāhu","e":"revealed it"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"لَيْلَةِ","d":"laylati","e":"(the) Night"},{"c":"الْقَدْرِ","d":"l-qadri","e":"(of) Power"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"لَيْلَةُ","d":"laylatu","e":"(the) Night"},{"c":"الْقَدْرِ","d":"l-qadri","e":"(of) Power (is)"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"لَيْلَةُ","d":"laylatu","e":"(The) Night"},{"c":"الْقَدْرِ","d":"l-qadri","e":"(of) Power"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"than"},{"c":"أَلْفِ","d":"alfi","e":"a thousand"},{"c":"شَهْرٍ","d":"shahrin","e":"month(s)"}],"a":{"g":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"تَنَزَّلُ","d":"tanazzalu","e":"Descend"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةُ","d":"l-malāikatu","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"وَالرُّوحُ","d":"wal-rūḥu","e":"and the Spirit"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"بِإِذْنِ","d":"bi-idh'ni","e":"by (the) permission"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"for"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"أَمْرٍ","d":"amrin","e":"affair"}],"a":{"g":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"سَلَامٌ","d":"salāmun","e":"Peace"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it (is)"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"مَطْلَعِ","d":"maṭlaʿi","e":"(the) emergence"},{"c":"الْفَجْرِ","d":"l-fajri","e":"(of) the dawn"}],"a":{"g":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn."}}}